<title>FINLAND: MERITA SOLD FIM 200 MLN REAL ESTATE.</title>
<headline>MERITA SOLD FIM 200 MLN REAL ESTATE.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish banking group Merita Oy's real estate unit Merita Kiinteistot Oy said on Thursday it had sold real estate worth almost 200 million markka to insurance group Tapiola-Yhtiot.</p>
<p>&quot;The real estate deals are the most significant in years. Their total value is almost 200 million markka,&quot; Merita said in a statement.  </p>
<p>The sold properties were located in downtown Helsinki and in the town of Oulu, it said.</p>
<p>&quot;Merita intends to free up capital mainly for renovation projects in the Helsinki city centre,&quot; Merita said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
</text>
